cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "IKOB Aporometrica (ikob2): a threshold-gate model of job accessibility"
abstract: >-
  Accessibility of jobs by household type and income decile when a trip is
  acceptable only if it passes both a time gate and a money gate, each the
  survival function of a traveller's maximum acceptable travel time and
  cost; with shared-bicycle chains and pricing and hub scenarios for
  Utrecht.
type: software
authors:
